diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 4469b86..32d06c0 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -60,3 +60,19 @@ Marks all unread notifications as read.
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## Email digests
+
+Each person chooses how notification emails are batched with `bundle_email_frequency` on their settings. The value is one of `never` (off), `every_few_hours` (every four hours), `daily`, or `weekly`.
+
+Notifications are grouped into non-overlapping time windows. The window starts when the first notification lands, not on a clock boundary. One email is sent per window when it closes. A notification that arrives late joins the window that has already opened rather than opening a second, overlapping window.
+
+Update the choice with `PATCH /:account_slug/notifications/settings`:
+
+```json
+{
+  "user_settings": {
+    "bundle_email_frequency": "daily"
+  }
+}
+```
